<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting me about transferring to Arizona State University. I’d be happy to meet with you to answer any questions and help you with the admission process.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you are interested in scheduling an in-person or phone appointment, you can do so at <a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/contact">transfer.asu.edu/contact</a>. If you decide to schedule a phone appointment, please make sure to have a computer with working Internet available to you during your appointment.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Want another option to see what it’s like to be a Sun Devil? We’d love to speak to you on one of Arizona State University’s four campus locations to discuss your transfer options. Appointments are held Fridays from 8:30 a.m. to 4 p.m. Please follow the directions below to schedule an appointment online.</div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><ol><li>Go to&nbsp;<a href="http://transfer.asu.edu/friday/week">transfer.asu.edu/friday/week</a>.</li><li>Available appointment times will appear on the calendar (Fridays only). For future dates, use the drop-down option under&nbsp;<b>View appointments by week</b>, then click&nbsp;<b>Go</b>.</li><li>Click&nbsp;<b>Make an appointment</b>&nbsp;on the date and time that works best for you (the ASU office location will be listed before you schedule an appointment). Submit the contact form that appears. After submitting your contact information, be sure to confirm your time to make the appointment.</li></ol></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">A confirmation email with the location will be emailed to you. While you’re on campus, we also hope you find your fit by&nbsp;<a href="http://visit.asu.edu/">scheduling a campus tour</a>.</div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>